PRODUCTION SOP SUMMARY

1. Mix Oil + DPG 3min (emulsification)
2. Add Alcohol slow 2min (gradual mixing)
3. Macerate 21 Days dark (aging process)
4. Filter once (clarification)
5. White Shirt Test before bottling (quality control)

